375
00:54:56,835 --> 00:54:58,962
about a thing
ກ່ຽວກັບສິ່ງໜຶ່ງ

376
00:55:00,005 --> 00:55:05,177
'cause every little thing
is gonna be all right
ເພາະທຸກສິ່ງນ້ອຍໆຈະດີດີ

377
00:55:08,639 --> 00:55:14,269
don't worry
about a thing
